| Feature                | Recommended implementation                                        |
| ---------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Authentication         | Secure one-time invitation redemption + HttpOnly session cookie   |
| Saved participant data | Firestore, accessed via Vercel Functions                          |
| Random matching        | Server-side derangement algorithm                                 |
| Scheduled matching     | Vercel Cron with server-side date verification                    |
| Scratch card           | HTML Canvas                                                       |
